{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07707","headline":"登望楚山最高顶 · 孟浩然","name":"登望楚山最高顶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山水观形胜，襄阳美会稽。\n最高唯望楚，曾未一攀跻。\n石壁疑削成，衆山比全低。\n晴明试登陟，目极无端倪。\n云梦掌中小，武陵花处迷。\n暝还归骑下，萝月映深谿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07707.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07707","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"刘文刚"}